--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a2d7aaa03f3e79c4a80d26882ec329e0, type: 3}
  m_Name: RadioDialogue1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::RadioDialogue
  dialogueLines:
  - name: Tio
    name_:
      m_TableReference:
        m_TableCollectionName: GUID:a49673578b4b8c545bc89e9b29a3133e
      m_TableEntryReference:
        m_KeyId: 22276931584
        m_Key: 
      m_FallbackState: 0
      m_WaitForCompletion: 0
      m_LocalVariables: []
    text: "Bem vindo ao \"Vocatio Abyssi\" Hugo! Aqui \xE9 onde nos tornaremos ricos
      meu jovem."
    text_:
      m_TableReference:
        m_TableCollectionName: GUID:a49673578b4b8c545bc89e9b29a3133e
      m_TableEntryReference:
        m_KeyId: 78077952000
        m_Key: 
      m_FallbackState: 0
      m_WaitForCompletion: 0
      m_LocalVariables: []
    delay: 0
    audioClip: {fileID: 0}
  - name: Tio
    name_:
      m_TableReference:
        m_TableCollectionName: GUID:a49673578b4b8c545bc89e9b29a3133e
      m_TableEntryReference:
        m_KeyId: 22276931584
        m_Key: 
      m_FallbackState: 0
      m_WaitForCompletion: 0
      m_LocalVariables: []
    text: "Como te disse, os peixes do mundo todo vem at\xE9 esse local a cada 8
      anos, estranho n\xE3o? Parece que as regras sobre habitats n\xE3o existem aqui."
    text_:
      m_TableReference:
        m_TableCollectionName: GUID:a49673578b4b8c545bc89e9b29a3133e
      m_TableEntryReference:
        m_KeyId: 1503105318912
        m_Key: 
      m_FallbackState: 0
      m_WaitForCompletion: 0
      m_LocalVariables: []
    delay: 0
    audioClip: {fileID: 0}
  - name: Tio
    name_:
      m_TableReference:
        m_TableCollectionName: GUID:a49673578b4b8c545bc89e9b29a3133e
      m_TableEntryReference:
        m_KeyId: 22276931584
        m_Key: 
      m_FallbackState: 0
      m_WaitForCompletion: 0
      m_LocalVariables: []
    text: "Hoje \xE9 o ultimo dia ent\xE3o n\xE3o vamos encontrar mais ningu\xE9m
      por aqui."
    text_:
      m_TableReference:
        m_TableCollectionName: GUID:a49673578b4b8c545bc89e9b29a3133e
      m_TableEntryReference:
        m_KeyId: 1580305678336
        m_Key: 
      m_FallbackState: 0
      m_WaitForCompletion: 0
      m_LocalVariables: []
    delay: 0
    audioClip: {fileID: 0}
  - name: Tio
    name_:
      m_TableReference:
        m_TableCollectionName: GUID:a49673578b4b8c545bc89e9b29a3133e
      m_TableEntryReference:
        m_KeyId: 22276931584
        m_Key: 
      m_FallbackState: 0
      m_WaitForCompletion: 0
      m_LocalVariables: []
    text: "Agora, vamos as instru\xE7\xF5es, seu barco veio equipado com um sonar,
      ele vai te guiar na localiza\xE7\xE3o dos peixes mais pr\xF3ximos, basta ir
      e pegar, n\xE3o importa o que voc\xEA pescar, vale dinheiro? Traz para casa"
    text_:
      m_TableReference:
        m_TableCollectionName: GUID:a49673578b4b8c545bc89e9b29a3133e
      m_TableEntryReference:
        m_KeyId: 1620063485952
        m_Key: 
      m_FallbackState: 0
      m_WaitForCompletion: 0
      m_LocalVariables: []
    delay: 6
    audioClip: {fileID: 0}
  - name: Tio
    name_:
      m_TableReference:
        m_TableCollectionName: GUID:a49673578b4b8c545bc89e9b29a3133e
      m_TableEntryReference:
        m_KeyId: 22276931584
        m_Key: 
      m_FallbackState: 0
      m_WaitForCompletion: 0
      m_LocalVariables: []
    text: "Eu vou estar aqui por perto, mas cada um no seu quadrado hein, seu Tio
      tamb\xE9m precisa de um dinheiro."
    text_:
      m_TableReference:
        m_TableCollectionName: GUID:a49673578b4b8c545bc89e9b29a3133e
      m_TableEntryReference:
        m_KeyId: 1704306081792
        m_Key: 
      m_FallbackState: 0
      m_WaitForCompletion: 0
      m_LocalVariables: []
    delay: 0
    audioClip: {fileID: 0}
  - name: Tio
    name_:
      m_TableReference:
        m_TableCollectionName: GUID:a49673578b4b8c545bc89e9b29a3133e
      m_TableEntryReference:
        m_KeyId: 22276931584
        m_Key: 
      m_FallbackState: 0
      m_WaitForCompletion: 0
      m_LocalVariables: []
    text: "Como voc\xEA deu um jeito de quebrar o microfone do seu r\xE1dio ent\xE3o
      n\xE3o vai ter como voc\xEA entrar em contato comigo, mas pelo menos eu posso
      te incomodar bastante."
    text_:
      m_TableReference:
        m_TableCollectionName: GUID:a49673578b4b8c545bc89e9b29a3133e
      m_TableEntryReference:
        m_KeyId: 1751588470784
        m_Key: 
      m_FallbackState: 0
      m_WaitForCompletion: 0
      m_LocalVariables: []
    delay: 0
    audioClip: {fileID: 0}
  - name: Tio
    name_:
      m_TableReference:
        m_TableCollectionName: GUID:a49673578b4b8c545bc89e9b29a3133e
      m_TableEntryReference:
        m_KeyId: 22276931584
        m_Key: 
      m_FallbackState: 0
      m_WaitForCompletion: 0
      m_LocalVariables: []
    text: Grandes expectativas hein, bem grandes. Boa Sorte marujo!
    text_:
      m_TableReference:
        m_TableCollectionName: GUID:a49673578b4b8c545bc89e9b29a3133e
      m_TableEntryReference:
        m_KeyId: 1839069069312
        m_Key: 
      m_FallbackState: 0
      m_WaitForCompletion: 0
      m_LocalVariables: []
    delay: 0
    audioClip: {fileID: 0}
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
